# A dies trigger "looks back in time" (CR 603.10a): it triggers on the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and a
# Doomed Traveler that dies while Dress Down is out had no abilities then (CR 613.1f), so its "When this creature dies,
# create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying" does not trigger: Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2, while Dress Down
# (cast with flash that turn) is out, kills it and no Spirit is made. Dress Down is sacrificed at that end step; on turn 4
# Bot2 bolts Bot1's second Doomed Traveler, which has its ability, and that one makes a Spirit (the positive control).

